      "why": "Full pipelining gives 1 result/cycle, so it is the only family that can meet the 32 req/us throughput and the 0.44us p99 batch constraint without queueing. Focusing on W=14-18 and N=12-18 brackets the 2^-12 accuracy requirement while keeping area low; rounding is fixed to 'round' for best accuracy per bit."
