      "budget_share": 0.4,
      "why": "pipelined_m with m=2-4 reduces FF count versus full pipelining while still achieving 1 result/cycle throughput. This trades a small latency increase (ceil(N/m)+2) for significant area savings, which is critical for the min luts_plus_ffs objective. The latency increase is small enough to still meet the 0.44us batch constraint at reasonable Fmax."
    }
